      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

      <p>Links marked <strong>Ad</strong> are affiliate or commercial links. If you buy, book, or sign up through those marked links, BriefPicks can earn a commission at no extra cost to you.</p>
      <p>Affiliate relationships do not decide whether a claim can be used. BriefPicks claims must be backed by a source such as published specifications, manuals, retailer or booking-platform information, official sources, or other public data.</p>
      <p>Unless we clearly say otherwise, product content is not a hands-on review. We do not use wording such as tested, hands-on, we tried, or reviewed unless that is true and evidenced.</p>
      <p>BriefPicks does not publish live price, stock, availability, urgency, or time-limited deal claims unless they are supported by an appropriate current source or API.</p>
      <p>As of 2026-06-05, BriefPicks is not using Amazon Associates links. If Amazon Associate links are used later, the required Amazon disclosure will appear and BriefPicks will not imply that Amazon sponsors, endorses, or approves BriefPicks.</p>

